{
  "id": "03026_kinisuru",
  "headword": "{気|き}にする",
  "reading": "きにする",
  "part_of_speech": "godan verb",
  "gloss": "to mind, to care about",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to mind, to care about",
      "explanation": "To worry about or pay attention to something."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "03026_kinisuru_ex1",
      "japanese": "{気|き}にしないで。",
      "english": "Don't worry about it.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "03026_kinisuru_ex2",
      "japanese": "{人|ひと}の{目|め}を{気|き}にする。",
      "english": "To care about what others think.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "03026_kinisuru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{細|こま}かいことを{気|き}にする。",
      "english": "To fuss over small details.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "03026_kinisuru_ex4",
      "japanese": "{他|ほか}の{人|ひと}の{目|め}を{気|き}にしすぎないでください。",
      "english": "Please don't worry too much about what others think.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "03026_kinisuru_ex5",
      "japanese": "{彼女|かのじょ}は{小|ちい}さなことを{気|き}にする{性格|せいかく}だ。",
      "english": "She has a personality that worries about small things.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "{気|き}にする means to actively mind or care about something.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {気|き}にしないで (don't worry about it)\n- {気|き}にしない (not to care)\n- 〜を{気|き}にする (to care about ~)\n- {人|ひと}の{目|め}を{気|き}にする (care about others' opinions)\n\nCONTRAST WITH {気|き}になる:\n- {気|き}にする: actively choosing to worry/care (volitional)\n- {気|き}になる: something weighing on mind (non-volitional)\n\nCOMMON PHRASE:\n{気|き}にしないで is a common way to say \"don't worry\" or \"never mind\".",
